(vector (map (:adr/consequences "{:canvas_followup \"club-shinshi canvas 準備項目 'PSP/crypto rail 解禁' now references\\n                    kotoba-lang/pay + JK株式会社 — update via gftd canvas note (generated\\n                    md not hand-edited)\", :crossover_review_moot \"ADR-2607071000's pending etzhayyim-side crossover review is no\\n                          longer needed (the crossover no longer exists)\", :followups [\"Superfluid / 0xSplits / Safe-escrow PayRail adapters\" \"first consumer wiring: club-shinshi tip with treasury verification feeding\\n               entitle\" \"consider neutral NSID for the monetization capability lexicon\" \"deps wiring in jk-luxury/club-shinshi and jk-luxury/net-babiniku\"], :out_of_scope \"@etzhayyim/sdk non-payment surfaces (atproto/encrypted/ipfs/...) stay\\n                 etzhayyim-internal\"}"), (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "settlement/operating entity for club-shinshi and net-babiniku creator monetization\n    (tip/subscribe/PPV) = JK株式会社 ('Shinshi Inc.', GitHub org jk-luxury) — etzhayyim is\n    not involved and keeps its donation-only rail unchanged" "the payment surface of @etzhayyim/sdk (pay.ts: pay/payStream/splitDistribute/escrow)\n    is re-homed as the vendor-neutral common library kotoba-lang/pay (pure .cljc, zero\n    network I/O, zero key custody, PayRail protocol seam, unprovisioned-rail honest default,\n    entitle = verify-before-honor)" "supersession of ADR-2607071000 Decision #1 (vendor consumes etzhayyim rail) and\n    Decision #4 (vendor->etzhayyim crossover proposal); its lexicon shape, client-side\n    signing, and verify-before-honor invariants are retained")), (:adr/supersedes (vector "adr-2607071000 (Decision #1 and #4 only)")), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay"), (:adr/related (vector "90-docs/adr/2607071000-net-babiniku-crypto-payment-rail-etzhayyim-consumption.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607062300-jk-luxury-org-club-shinshi-net-babiniku-relocation.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607051621-treasury-extraction.edn" "90-docs/adr/2605220000-shinshi-psp-freeze.edn")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607092700-shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-09"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607092700: club-shinshi/net-babiniku の決済主体を Shinshi Inc（JK株式会社）へ、@etzhayyim/sdk 決済表面を kotoba-lang/pay 共通ライブラリへ\n\n- **Status**: accepted（2026-07-09 オーナー指示: 「club-shinshi は etzhayyim じゃなくて\n  shinshi inc にして。@etzhayyim/sdk は kotoba-lang repo で共通ライブラリにしなおして」）\n- **Supersedes**: ADR-2607071000 の Decision #1（etzhayyim レール消費）と Decision #4\n  （vendor→etzhayyim crossover 提案）。同 ADR の lexicon shape・client-side signing・\n  verify-before-honor の各不変条件は**継承**する。\n- **Related**: ADR-2607062200（babiniku creator monetization / honest-default）、\n  ADR-2607011940（base-l2 の etzhayyim-sdk → kotoba-lang relocation 前例）、\n  ADR-2607051621（kotoba-lang/treasury 抽出）、ADR-2607062300（club-shinshi /\n  net-babiniku の jk-luxury org transfer）、ADR-2605220000（shinshi PSP 凍結）\n\n## Context\n\nclub-shinshi（gftd 唯一の `:live` 収益 = ExoClick ad）と net-babiniku（chat 稼働、\nmonetization は HARD-hold）の creator 課金（tip / subscribe / PPV）解禁は、\nADR-2607071000 で「vendor アプリが etzhayyim の Base L2/USDC レールを\n`@etzhayyim/sdk` 経由で消費する」設計だった。しかしこの設計には構造矛盾がある:\n\n1. **教義の不整合**: etzhayyim の substrate boundary（`orgs/etzhayyim/root/CLAUDE.md`）\n   は payment purpose として `donation`/`kisha`/`grant`/`tithe` 系のみを許可し、\n   **外部向け `tip` / `subscription` / `purchase` を明示的に禁止**している。creator\n   課金はまさにその禁止対象で、etzhayyim レールは本件の正しい家では最初から無かった。\n2. **未承認の crossover**: vendor→etzhayyim の消費パターンは ADR-2605211950 に\n   worked example が無く、etzhayyim 側レビュー待ちのブロッカーになっていた。\n3. **実装の空洞**: `@etzhayyim/sdk` は `pay()` のみ実装、`payStream` /\n   `splitDistribute` / `verify()` は stub。特に `verify()` 不在は entitlement 付与の\n   前提を欠き、全 monetization が HARD-hold のままだった。\n\n一方、SDK からの決済部品の kotoba-lang への relocation は既に前例と部分実装がある:\n`kotoba-lang/base-l2`（ADR-2607011940 で etzhayyim-sdk から relocate。RPC +\nERC-4337 paymaster）、`kotoba-lang/treasury`（ADR-2607051621。USDC quote /\n**on-chain 検証** / append-only ledger — `verify()` 相当）、`kotoba-lang/wallet`\n（non-custodial signing）、`kotoba-lang/kessai`（fiat ISO レール抽象、兄弟）。\n\n## Decision\n\n1. **決済・運営主体は JK株式会社（\"Shinshi Inc.\"、GitHub org `jk-luxury`）。**\n   club-shinshi / net-babiniku は 2026-07-06 に jk-luxury へ transfer 済み\n   （ADR-2607062300）であり、creator 課金の事業主体・PSP/AML/風営法対応・\n   platform take（80/20 の 20）の帰属はすべて JK株式会社側。etzhayyim は本件に\n   関与しない（donation-only レールを自陣に保持するのみ。変更不要）。\n\n2. **`@etzhayyim/sdk` の決済表面を `kotoba-lang/pay` として共通ライブラリ化**\n   （public、Apache-2.0）。pure `.cljc`・network I/O ゼロ・鍵保持ゼロの\n   kotoba-lang 層契約（base-l2/treasury と同型）で、`pay.ts` の\n   pay / payStream / splitDistribute / escrow 表面を移植:\n   - 純関数: USDC 単位（parse/format）、streaming flow-rate、80/20\n     `creator-platform-split`（端数は creator 側）、monetization capability\n     検証（ADR-2607071000 の lexicon shape を中立化）、receipt、\n     **`entitle` = verify-before-honor 判定**。\n   - 注入座席: `PayRail` protocol。on-chain 実効は host が base-l2（転送 +\n     ERC-4337）/ treasury（検証）/ wallet（署名）で裏打ちする。\n   - honest default: `unprovisioned-rail` は全操作を\n     `:pay/unprovisioned-capability` で HOLD（babiniku の\n     `UnprovisionedCapability` パターン踏襲。決済を偽装しない）。\n   - 初版実測: 7 tests / 49 assertions green、clj-kondo errors 0。\n\n3. **chain スタック自体は変更しない**（Base L2 / USDC・EURC・JPYC /\n   passkey smart wallet / 署名は payer デバイス側）。変わるのは**運営主体と\n   コードの家**であって暗号学的レールではない。platform-held private key の\n   禁止も従来どおり維持する。\n\n4. **経済モデルへの帰結（逆トポロジーソートの B3 ゲート更新）**: creator 課金\n   解禁のクリティカルパスは「etzhayyim 側レビュー + SDK stub 実装待ち」から\n   「**kotoba-lang/pay の rail adapter 実装 + treasury 検証の配線**（Shinshi Inc\n   側で完結）」に変わり、外部組織依存が消える。着火順は\n   ①shinshi（ad :live → tip 解禁）→ ②babiniku（tip/subscribe）→ 決済 GMV が\n   murakumo（生成 GPU）/ net-kotobase（storage）需要へ→ kotoba/kotobase\n   （identity/可搬性層）に沈殿、で不変。\n\n## Consequences\n\n- club-shinshi の canvas「準備 (club-shinshi-creator-take): PSP/crypto rail 解禁」の\n  参照先は etzhayyim settlement から kotoba-lang/pay + JK株式会社運営に変わる。\n  business-model md は生成物のため手編集せず、`gftd canvas note` 経由の更新を\n  follow-up とする。\n- ADR-2607071000 が提起した etzhayyim 側レビュー（vendor→etzhayyim crossover）は\n  **不要になった**（crossover 自体が消滅）。\n- follow-up: (a) Superfluid / 0xSplits / Safe-escrow adapter の実装、\n  (b) treasury 検証を `entitle` の verification 入力に配線した最初の消費者\n  （club-shinshi tip が最短）、(c) `net.babiniku.monetization.capability` lexicon の\n  中立 NSID 化の要否検討、(d) jk-luxury 側 repo（club-shinshi / net-babiniku）への\n  deps 配線。\n- `@etzhayyim/sdk` 本体（atproto / encrypted / ipfs 等の非決済表面）は本 ADR の\n  スコープ外（従来どおり etzhayyim 内部用。決済表面のみ中立化）。"), (:adr/decision "{:operator \"JK株式会社 ('Shinshi Inc.', org jk-luxury) owns creator-monetization\\n             settlement, platform take (20% of 80/20), and PSP/AML/regulatory posture\\n             for club-shinshi + net-babiniku; etzhayyim uninvolved\", :new_repo \"kotoba-lang/pay\", :library {:layer_contract \"pure .cljc, zero network I/O, zero key custody — same as\\n                    kotoba-lang/base-l2 and treasury\", :pure [\"parse-usdc / format-usdc (6-decimal micros, truncating parse)\" \"flow-rate-per-second (Superfluid-shaped)\" \"split-allocations / creator-platform-split (80/20, dust to creator,\\n           total invariant)\" \"capability-errors / valid-capability? / expired? (generalized\\n           net.babiniku.monetization.capability shape)\" \"->receipt (string micros on the wire)\" \"entitle = verify-before-honor decision (grant only on host-verified\\n           settlement covering the authorized amount)\"], :seam \"PayRail protocol (-pay! -pay-stream! -pay-stream-stop! -split-distribute!\\n          -escrow-open! -escrow-release!) — hosts back with base-l2 (transfer/ERC-4337),\\n          treasury (verification), wallet (signing)\", :honest_default \"unprovisioned-rail HOLDs every operation with\\n                    :pay/unprovisioned-capability — never fake a settlement\", :verified \"7 tests / 49 assertions green (clojure -M:test), clj-kondo errors 0\"}, :chain_stack_unchanged \"Base L2 / USDC・EURC・JPYC / passkey smart wallet /\\n                          payer-device signing / no platform-held private key —\\n                          the operator and code home change, not the cryptographic rail\", :economic_gate_update \"reverse-toposort B3 gate (creator-monetization unlock) moves\\n                         from 'etzhayyim review + SDK stub implementation' to\\n                         'kotoba-lang/pay rail adapters + treasury verification wiring',\\n                         fully owned on the Shinshi Inc side; ignition order unchanged:\\n                         shinshi tip -> babiniku tip/subscribe -> GMV demand into\\n                         murakumo/net-kotobase -> kotoba/kotobase identity layer\"}"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/problem "{:source \"owner directive 2026-07-09: 'club-shinshi は etzhayyim じゃなくて shinshi inc\\n           にして。@etzhayyim/sdk は kotoba-lang repo で共通ライブラリにしなおして'\", :investigated [\"etzhayyim substrate boundary (orgs/etzhayyim/root/CLAUDE.md) prohibits external\\n    tip/subscription/purchase payment purposes — creator monetization was doctrinally\\n    incompatible with consuming etzhayyim's rail from the start\" \"vendor->etzhayyim consumption crossover had no worked example in ADR-2605211950 and\\n    was blocked on etzhayyim-side review\" \"@etzhayyim/sdk implementation state: only pay() real; payStream/splitDistribute/\\n    verify() are stubs; missing verify() alone forces HARD-hold on every entitlement\" \"relocation precedent + building blocks already in kotoba-lang: base-l2 (relocated\\n    from etzhayyim-sdk per ADR-2607011940), treasury (USDC on-chain verification +\\n    ledger = the verify() shape), wallet (non-custodial signing), kessai (fiat ISO\\n    sibling)\" \"club-shinshi/net-babiniku already transferred to jk-luxury (JK株式会社) 2026-07-06\\n    per ADR-2607062300 — the corporate vessel exists\"], :risk \"adult-business crypto settlement needs per-jurisdiction legal review (資金決済法/\\n         AML); this ADR moves the code home and the operating entity, it does not clear\\n         legal gates\"}"), (:adr/alternatives "[{:option \"keep ADR-2607071000's design (vendor consumes etzhayyim rail)\", :rejected_because \"doctrinally incompatible (etzhayyim prohibits external\\n                      tip/subscription/purchase) and organizationally blocked\\n                      (unreviewed crossover, unimplemented stubs)\"} {:option \"fold the surface into kotoba-lang/treasury or kessai instead of a new repo\", :rejected_because \"treasury is quote/verify/ledger and kessai is fiat ISO rails —\\n                      both are composed BY pay, not homes for the creator-rail surface;\\n                      a focused repo keeps the layer boundaries legible\"} {:option \"port the TS SDK as-is (viem, key-holding PayClient)\", :rejected_because \"violates the kotoba-lang layer contract (zero vendor SDK, zero\\n                      custody) and the repo-wide runtime priority (.cljc first);\\n                      the EOA privateKey PayClient also contradicted the no-server-key\\n                      invariant the SDK itself stated\"}]"), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607092700: club-shinshi/net-babiniku settlement operator = Shinshi Inc (JK株式会社), @etzhayyim/sdk payment surface re-homed as kotoba-lang/pay"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))